    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "opxOSS 6.5 - UML engine & Wi-Fi in Linux",
      "description": "A second rootless engine: User Mode Linux boots as a normal process, with no CPU emulation, and opxOSS now probes the device and picks the engine itself. Wi-Fi can run inside Linux for adapters Android has no driver for, while root keeps running everything else. Also new: a Wordlists manager, a hash cracker, a live attack monitor, a USB chain that shows where an adapter stops, a customizable dashboard, diagnostics export and a Chinese translation. arm64-v8a only.",
      "newsDate": "2026-10-03",
      "newsUrl": "https://github.com/OPX-Aminul/opx-oss/releases/tag/6.5",
      "imageUrl": "",
